      ":question/problem": "In the year $2001$, there were approximately $12520$ crimes in a particular city. The police department then promised a $10.6\\%$ annual *decrease* in crime, continuously compounded. According to this model, how many crimes occurred in $2012$? Round your answer to the nearest integer.\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question.",
